   "versionNonce": 381976,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Boundary rules enforced by design:\n1. The browser bundle contains no LLM key and no database URL \u2014 both live only in the Render environment.\n2. No controller touches Prisma directly; the service layer is the only place a query is constructed, which is what makes the tenant guarantee auditable.\n3. The orchestrator is invoked from exactly one route, so agent execution can never be triggered without passing the full middleware chain first.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "fqd74wqm3rwfhcztf5",
   "originalText": "Boundary rules enforced by design:\n1. The browser bundle contains no LLM key and no database URL \u2014 both live only in the Render environment.\n2. No controller touches Prisma directly; the service layer is the only place a query is constructed, which is what makes the tenant guarantee auditable.\n3. The orchestrator is invoked from exactly one route, so agent execution can never be triggered without passing the full middleware chain first.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 13
  },
