   "versionNonce": 992742,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Confidence aggregation \u2014 deterministic",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "2h1arrhs8yq8i1mfgu",
   "originalText": "Confidence aggregation \u2014 deterministic",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 14
  },
  {
   "id": "cyt4besr7xj6outjqh",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1310,
   "y": 4017,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 319.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 904294,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 220095,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "ibwyjrn6pzs9rv45oe",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "ibwyjrn6pzs9rv45oe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1322,
   "y": 4029,
   "width": 376,
   "height": 255.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#5f3a00",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 808581,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 515110,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each agent self-reports confidence 0..1.\nThe Strategy Agent does NOT invent the final\nnumber; code computes it:\n\nbase = 0.30\u00b7mkt + 0.25\u00b7demand + 0.25\u00b7inv\n           + 0.20\u00b7strategy\n\npenalties applied in code:\n\u00b7 \u22120.15 if competitor data > 7 days stale\n\u00b7 \u22120.10 if agents disagree on direction\n\u00b7 \u22120.20 if any required tool call failed\n\u00b7 \u22120.10 if price delta exceeds 15%\n\nfinal = clamp(base \u2212 penalties, 0, 1)\n\nDefensible in interview: the LLM supplies\njudgement, arithmetic stays in code.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "cyt4besr7xj6outjqh",
   "originalText": "Each agent self-reports confidence 0..1.\nThe Strategy Agent does NOT invent the final\nnumber; code computes it:\n\nbase = 0.30\u00b7mkt + 0.25\u00b7demand + 0.25\u00b7inv\n           + 0.20\u00b7strategy\n\npenalties applied in code:\n\u00b7 \u22120.15 if competitor data > 7 days stale\n\u00b7 \u22120.10 if agents disagree on direction\n\u00b7 \u22120.20 if any required tool call failed\n\u00b7 \u22120.10 if price delta exceeds 15%\n\nfinal = clamp(base \u2212 penalties, 0, 1)\n\nDefensible in interview: the LLM supplies\njudgement, arithmetic stays in code.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "g1o5s7kde7nd4tgsed",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 4582,
   "width": 1240,
   "height": 42.849999999999994,
   "angle": 0,
