   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Cost posture (asked for explicitly in the assessment email):\nGroq free tier covers development and the live demo; a full 5-agent run costs roughly 6\u20139k tokens.  Render free web service and Supabase free tier cover hosting and the database.  Vercel hobby covers the frontend.  Total running cost for the submitted system: $0.\nAt production scale the dominant line item is LLM inference, which is why recommendations are generated per-SKU on demand and cached rather than swept across the whole catalogue on a schedule.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "84omp1qz90s0rup79u",
   "originalText": "Cost posture (asked for explicitly in the assessment email):\nGroq free tier covers development and the live demo; a full 5-agent run costs roughly 6\u20139k tokens.  Render free web service and Supabase free tier cover hosting and the database.  Vercel hobby covers the frontend.  Total running cost for the submitted system: $0.\nAt production scale the dominant line item is LLM inference, which is why recommendations are generated per-SKU on demand and cached rather than swept across the whole catalogue on a schedule.",
